k to base-\\(b\\):**\n   \\[\n   b^5 + b^3 + b^2 = 1 \\cdot b^5 + 0 \\cdot b^4 + 1 \\cdot b^3 + 1 \\cdot b^2 + 0 \\cdot b + 0 = 101100_b\n   \\]\n\nThe final answer is \\(\\boxed{101100_b}\\).","id":"number_theory:451"}
